---
title: Research
order: 2
permalink: /research/
description: Research projects in computational astrophysics, cosmology, dark matter and particle physics.
---
{% import "partials/figure.njk" as f %}

{% if research.note %}
<p class="lead"><em>{{ research.note }}</em> — see the <a href="{{ '/research-blog/' | url }}">research blog</a> for write-ups and notes as they happen.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="focus">Research Focus</h2>

<h3>Summary</h3>

{% for para in research.summary %}
<p>{{ para | mdi | safe }}</p>
{% endfor %}

<h3>Areas of Interest</h3>

{% for area in research.areas %}
<p>{{ area.label }}</p>
<ul class="chips">
  {%- for item in area.items %}
  <li><span>{{ item }}</span></li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{% endfor %}

<h2 id="current">Current Research</h2>

{% for item in research.current %}{{ f.entry(item) }}{% endfor %}

<h2 id="previous">Previous Research</h2>

{% for item in research.previous %}{{ f.entry(item) }}{% endfor %}

<h2 id="writing">Writing</h2>

<p>Longer-form notes, code snippets and thoughts on astronomy live in the research blog.</p>

<p><a class="button" href="{{ '/research-blog/' | url }}">Open the research blog <span class="ext" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
